Package: jpDMEQR
Type: Package
Title: Debiased Profile Inference for High-Dimensional Mixed-Effects Quantile Regression
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Jian", family = "Hou", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "houjian@ruc.edu.cn")
Author: Jian Hou [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Jian Hou <houjian@ruc.edu.cn>
Description: Research implementation for regularised profile estimation and
    coordinate-wise debiased inference in high-dimensional mixed-effects
    quantile regression with many independent, small clusters. The repository
    retains the original jointly penalised implementation for provenance and
    adds a correctness-first reference implementation of the exact profile
    score, Schur-complement effective Hessian, row-wise Dantzig inversion, and
    cluster sandwich variance used in the Scandinavian Journal of Statistics
    reconstruction.
